w.acfun.cn/v/ac41779395","hotComment":{"id":"791468448","user":{"id":"613012","name":"丧心病狂的我","avatar":"9d2fed7fb3c58954020035ee"},"text":"可以给图哥加个纸尿裤吗，玩恐怖游戏的时候可以用上[emot=acfun,1689/]","images":[],"likes":227}},{"key":"video:41901843","id":"41901843","kind":"video","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1690017323232,"text":"","title":"【A站独家】《笼》越珍贵~越浪费~","images":[],"cover":"30781a33b83fd1fa56498285","duration":"4:40","views":19285,"counts":{"commentCount":146,"likeCount":2697,"bananaCount":10502,"shareCount":60},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/v/ac41901843","hotComment":{"id":"791852699","user":{"id":"235096","name":"在妹子海上荡漾的水手","avatar":"be2a5d66f1ac608dc0f414cc"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1656/]4090利用它强大的运算性能，成功提高了1001电脑的功耗，主机电源在被压榨的情况下成功调整了电流表现，将出厂时暴躁的火电变成了深邃而醇厚的水电，恰好契合了阿水的成熟女中音，提升了高频细节，在中频融入了一丝属于火电的底噪，让声线略带嘶哑的同时也变得更耐听。虽然这歌不以为低频为卖点，但4090巧妙地利用它的图形处理能力将低频信号变成了以大海为主题的背景，将声音化为画面，如此处理堪称神来之笔。4090，你真棒！[emot=acfun,1656/]","images":[],"likes":57}}],"media":{"05d53ccf12b6ba82be3a8181":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_57ed8f275446411f811897456bb971de.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfNTdlZDhmMjc1NDQ2NDExZjgxMTg5NzQ1NmJiOTcxZGUucG5n.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8qOwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGisxNzk5MjJfNTdlZDhmMjc1NDQ2NDExZjgxMTg5NzQ1NmJiOTcxZGUucG5n.jpg"]},"30781a33b83fd1fa56498285":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_0c6fc3ac2c4e4b1cadff900343d8259a.jpeg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8qPAoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGiwxNzk5MjJfMGM2ZmMzYWMyYzRlNGIxY2FkZmY5MDAzNDNkODI1OWEuanBlZw.jpg","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8qPAoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGiwxNzk5MjJfMGM2ZmMzYWMyYzRlNGIxY2FkZmY5MDAzNDNkODI1OWEuanBlZw.jpg"]},"5925de6c1646f8a0edf9de9e":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_c1d91d58ecaf4e1aa9c0a7e87401c7c8.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8q